<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="17" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">We will extend the original liquidity strategy by introducing a trend-based constraint, allowing the trader to control how and when liquidity setups are taken.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
