<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="22" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If a liquidity indicator identifies a supply zone against that trend, the signal may indicate temporary exhaustion or a minor pullback rather than a full reversal.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
