<trans-unit id="66" mq:minorversionend="1" mq:minorversionstart="1" mq:status="PreTranslated" mq:percent="101" mq:segmentguid="3198fb06-4da9-45c9-b126-e392e929fce0" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="2026-11-17T11:15:07Z" mq:lastchanginguser="antoni_jee" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="33" mq:lastlabel="33" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="true">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="33">Aligning with the trend does not guarantee success, but it significantly increases the probability that a setup will reach its intended target.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve">Работа в направлении тренда не гарантирует успеха, но значительно повышает вероятность того, что сетап достигнет намеченной цели.</target>
