<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="48" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">According to our trend-alignment rule, short opportunities require the supply zone to be positioned below the EMA 50 to confirm bearish bias.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
