<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="65" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In this case, the requirement was not to rewrite the existing liquidity strategy, but to extend it in a controlled and non-invasive way.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">html / body#1 / div#2 / p#16 / p#16</context>
