<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="66" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Rather than embedding trend checks directly inside the Expert Advisor, I chose to isolate that responsibility into a dedicated filter module.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
