<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="168" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The OnTick function is guarded so that all logic runs only on a new bar, ensuring consistency between candle-based logic and trend evaluation.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
