<trans-unit id="338" mq:minorversionend="1" mq:minorversionstart="1" mq:status="PreTranslated" mq:percent="101" mq:segmentguid="f68fbe72-2658-4d0a-a9dc-39f2ed0380e2" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="2026-11-17T11:15:07Z" mq:lastchanginguser="antoni_jee" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="224" mq:lastlabel="224" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="true">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="224">A strategy becomes robust not by capturing every possible setup, but by operating within clearly defined boundaries that reflect market structure.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve">Стратегия становится устойчивой не за счет охвата каждого возможного сетапа, а благодаря работе в четко заданных границах, отражающих рыночную структуру.</target>
