<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="276" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The Expert Advisor detects base–impulse candle structures, places layered pending limit orders within liquidity zones, manages execution timing on a per-bar basis, and delegates directional validation to the TrendFilter module for improved trade quality.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
